#: ../../../dev/builtin_compatibility.md:3
msgid "GCC Compatibility of Builtins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../dev/builtin_compatibility.md:5
msgid ""
"LLVM-libc is written with Clang as the reference compiler but is expected to "
"build under GCC as well. Many headers reach for compiler intrinsics "
"(`__builtin_*`) for fast paths and for IEEE-754 semantics. Not every "
"`__builtin_*` exists in every compiler. a large family is Clang-only, and "
"several others were added in specific GCC releases. This page records which "
"builtins the libc code base references today and the minimum GCC basepoint "
"that ships each one."
msgstr ""

